render_pipeline.module.main_render.attribute.volumetric_cloud_detail_scale.description=Controls the spacing of fine volumetric cloud detail.
render_pipeline.module.main_render.attribute.volumetric_cloud_coverage.description=Controls the overall coverage of volumetric clouds.
render_pipeline.module.main_render.attribute.volumetric_cloud_clear_amount.description=Controls volumetric cloud coverage in clear weather.
