render_pipeline.module.main_render.attribute.volumetric_cloud_ambient_steps.description=Controls the number of ambient light samples inside volumetric clouds.
render_pipeline.module.main_render.attribute.volumetric_cloud_ambient_strength.description=Controls the ambient light brightness inside volumetric clouds.
render_pipeline.module.main_render.attribute.volumetric_cloud_powder_strength.description=Controls scattered light brightness at volumetric cloud edges.
render_pipeline.module.main_render.attribute.volumetric_cloud_weather_scale.description=Controls the scale of volumetric cloud distribution patterns.
